\title{anydoc: Convert Documents to Markdown}
\description{
Converts 'Microsoft Word', 'PowerPoint' and 'Excel' documents, 'OpenDocument' files, Rich Text Format (RTF), Electronic Publication (EPUB), comma-separated values (CSV) and Portable Document Format (PDF) files to Markdown, in the 'GitHub' Flavored Markdown dialect. The conversion is performed by the 'anydoc' \url{https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc} 'Rust' library, which is compiled and linked when the package is installed. The input format is detected from the file contents rather than from its extension, so a file carrying the wrong extension still converts correctly. Every format is rendered through a single Markdown serializer, so headings, tables and lists are represented consistently whichever parser handled the input.
